{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_105_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，毛伯來求金。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"求車猶可，求金甚矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"二、夫人姜氏如齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"三、二月，叔孫得臣如京師。辛丑，葬襄王。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"京，大也。師，眾也。言周，必以眾與大言之也。天子志崩不志葬，舉天下而葬一人，其道不疑也。志葬，危不得葬也。日之，甚矣，其不葬之辭也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"四、晉人殺其大夫先都。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"五、三月，夫人姜氏至自齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"卑以尊致，病文公也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"六、晉人殺其大夫士縠及箕鄭父。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"稱人以殺，誅有罪也。鄭父累也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"七、楚人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"八、公子遂會晉人、宋人、衞人、許人救鄭。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"九、夏，狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"十、秋，八月，曹伯襄卒。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"十一、九月，癸酉，地震。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"震，動也，地不震者也。震，故謹而日之也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"十二、冬，楚子使萩來聘。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"楚無大夫，其曰荻何也？以其來我，褒之也。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"十三、秦人來歸僖公、成風之襚。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_20","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"秦人弗夫人也，即外之弗夫人而見正焉。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_clt_105_21","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_105","textTraditional":"十四、葬曹共公。","sentenceOrder":21}],"overrides":{}}